message: >
  If you use this code or its results in published work, please cite the
  relevant version below. See CHANGELOG.md for the per-version result
  summaries; v0.3-prelim-D15-CORRECTED3 and Mediator_Detection_v12 are the
  most recent closed rounds at the time of publication.
